JUJUTSU KAISEN
The Culling Game Part 1

01:31.510 --> 01:32.840
Nice to meet you.

01:32.840 --> 01:36.870
Child of Zen'in, Descendant of Michizane,
Cursed Womb Death Painting,

01:36.870 --> 01:40.070
and Vessel of Sukuna.

01:40.070 --> 01:43.710
No greeting for me, Tengen?

01:43.710 --> 01:44.200
So this...

01:44.200 --> 01:44.700
So this thing...

01:44.700 --> 01:45.370
So this person...

01:45.370 --> 01:46.070
Person?

01:46.070 --> 01:47.110
...is Tengen?!

01:47.700 --> 01:50.080
It's not our first time meeting,

01:50.300 --> 01:51.950
Yuki Tsukumo.

01:51.950 --> 01:54.500
Why did you close the Tombs of the Star?

01:55.280 --> 01:59.110
I was wary of you being
aligned with Kenjaku.

01:59.110 --> 02:02.970
I can't tell what's going on
in people's hearts, after all.

02:02.970 --> 02:04.380
Kenjaku?

02:05.440 --> 02:07.680
What was once Noritoshi Kamo.

02:07.680 --> 02:11.390
The sorcerer currently inhabiting
Suguru Geto's body.

02:11.390 --> 02:14.780
A net of compassion and
a rope of salvation, huh?

02:14.780 --> 02:16.880
He didn't even try for
sarcasm with that name.

02:17.880 --> 02:20.210
Why are you like that, Tengen-sama?

02:20.210 --> 02:23.170
Ballsy of him to insert himself
into the conversation there...

02:23.870 --> 02:26.880
I'm immortal, but not ageless.

02:26.880 --> 02:29.660
You'd look like this, too,
if you were 500 years old.

02:29.590 --> 02:30.800
Seriously?

02:29.660 --> 02:30.790
Seriously?

02:31.800 --> 02:33.960
Since I failed to assimilate

02:33.960 --> 02:38.400
with the Star Plasma Vessel twelve
years ago, my aging has accelerated,

02:38.400 --> 02:41.260
and my identity as an
individual has vanished,

02:41.260 --> 02:44.430
so the world itself is who I am now.

02:45.240 --> 02:49.250
So there wasn't actually another
Star Plasma Vessel back then?

02:49.910 --> 02:52.670
That explains why there isn't a new voice.

02:53.150 --> 02:54.600
Excuse me.

02:54.600 --> 03:00.080
We came here to learn Kenjaku's goal
and how to open the Prison Realm.

03:00.080 --> 03:02.200
Could you tell us what you know?

03:04.200 --> 03:05.700
Of course.

03:05.700 --> 03:10.230
Or so I'd like to say, but I
must impose one condition.

03:10.230 --> 03:11.690
Yuta Okkotsu.

03:11.690 --> 03:12.860
Yuki Tsukumo.

03:12.860 --> 03:14.330
Cursed Womb Death Painting.

03:14.900 --> 03:18.220
I'll need two of you three to remain here

03:18.620 --> 03:20.670
