03:21.150 --> 03:23.720
Guard you? But you're immortal, right?

03:24.060 --> 03:26.440
Are you afraid of being sealed or something?

03:26.440 --> 03:27.980
That isn't fair.

03:28.370 --> 03:31.270
You won't tell us why or
how long we're guarding you?

03:38.700 --> 03:40.060
In that case,

03:43.280 --> 03:45.940
