03:44.910 --> 03:51.380
Kenjaku's Objective

03:46.730 --> 03:48.660
That man's objective

03:48.660 --> 03:53.110
is to force the evolution of
mankind throughout all of Japan.

03:51.380 --> 03:54.420
The Evolution of Mankind Throughout All Japan

03:54.420 --> 03:55.980
