into jujutsu sorcerers

04:03.220 --> 04:08.440
Idle Transfiguration

04:03.840 --> 04:08.080
with Idle Transfiguration back then?

04:08.480 --> 04:19.070
Idle Transfiguration

04:08.480 --> 04:13.440
The Evolution of Mankind Throughout All Japan

04:10.000 --> 04:14.140
Because he simply lacked the
cursed energy to do that.

04:14.660 --> 04:18.620
The cursed energy refined through
Maelstrom can't return to the sorcerer.

04:14.690 --> 04:19.070
Insufficient Cursed Energy

04:19.060 --> 04:23.720
