with a cursed technique is far too inefficient.

04:19.070 --> 04:28.120
Kenjaku's Objective

04:19.070 --> 04:28.120
The Evolution of Mankind Throughout All Japan

04:23.700 --> 04:28.120
How?

04:23.700 --> 04:28.120
Assimilate Mankind With Tengen

04:23.700 --> 04:28.120
Why?

04:23.700 --> 04:28.120
Unknown

04:23.720 --> 04:26.610
