04:42.220 --> 04:43.390
Star Plasma Vessel's Death

04:43.390 --> 04:45.060
Assimilation With the Star Plasma Vessel Prevented

04:43.950 --> 04:47.350
But since I started evolving
twelve years ago,

04:45.060 --> 04:46.640
Tengen

04:46.640 --> 04:47.350
Tengen's Evolution

04:47.350 --> 04:53.570
Tengen's Evolution

04:49.910 --> 04:54.540
assimilation with someone other than
