05:01.720 --> 05:06.230
What you see before you right
now isn't my real self.

05:06.230 --> 05:10.190
Now that I've evolved,
my soul is everywhere.

05:10.530 --> 05:11.720
I told you, didn't I?

05:11.720 --> 05:14.070
The world itself is who I am now.

05:14.070 --> 05:18.250
People who assimilated with me now would
become something more than a sorcerer.

05:18.250 --> 05:22.460
They would become a new being
that's both there and not there.

05:22.460 --> 05:25.180
I'm able to retain my shape and reason

05:25.180 --> 05:28.630
after evolving because of
my barrier techniques.

05:28.630 --> 05:30.830
However, if mankind were to evolve,

05:30.830 --> 05:34.440
then if even one of them
went out of control,

05:34.110 --> 05:35.570
Out of Control

05:35.350 --> 05:36.560
the world would end.

05:36.560 --> 05:37.570
