05:39.990 --> 05:42.740
Out of Control

05:42.740 --> 05:46.100
The impurities of a hundred million
people would flood the world.

05:46.100 --> 05:50.210
What happened in Tokyo would be
recreated on a worldwide scale.

05:50.620 --> 05:52.870
Why would he do such a thing?

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
Kenjaku's Objective

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
The Evolution of Mankind Throughout All Japan

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
How?

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
Why?

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
Assimilate Mankind With Tengen

05:52.870 --> 05:56.300
Unknown

05:53.370 --> 05:54.450
I don't know.

05:54.450 --> 05:56.120
I told you that, too.

05:56.120 --> 05:59.710
I can't tell what's going
on in people's hearts.

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
Kenjaku's Objective

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
The Evolution of Mankind Throughout All Japan

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
How?

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
Why?

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
Assimilate Mankind With Tengen

05:56.380 --> 05:57.840
Unknown

05:58.130 --> 06:00.380
Why?

05:58.130 --> 06:00.380
Unknown

